DIRECTOR
=======

This repository contains original DIRECTOR application code (MIT, see LICENSE)
plus a research handoff package produced on 2026-11-23.

Third-party research notices
----------------------------
The research package under docs/ and docs/research/ describes and quotes
selected upstream projects at pinned revisions. No upstream runtime code is
vendored into the DIRECTOR application. Original license/notice texts are
preserved verbatim under docs/research/licenses/ and indexed by
docs/research/licenses/manifest.json.

Upstream projects referenced by the research package:

  Headroom            Apache-2.0   revision ce0460cfa8598dc939243dbc7aec4b2d35f4e44a
  Ponytail            MIT          revision ebd8654c2c627f721eb8f9c0d1bd4090a29f9e10
  Superpowers         MIT          revision 22f0b463e7a5e579904dd6211a520321035526f7
  ECC                 MIT (root)   revision 4adeee6732a12d1540f49a4d50a38ce8c97f9a53
