                                   docs/research/licensing and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md)

External runtimes used, not distributed
--------------------------------------
Edge/Chrome and Node.js are optional local runtimes for the website pilot. They
are invoked as external processes and are not distributed with DIRECTOR.
The optional Python MCP SDK is used only for protocol conformance tests.
